they are simply presented in a linear, left-to-right order. No URLs, parame=
ters, or other additional information is present beyond the letters themsel=
ves.  The letters are spaced evenly apart, suggesting an ordered list or a =
simple data stream." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"193" height=3D"12" decoding=
=3D"async" data-nimg=3D"1" style=3D"color:transparent" src=3D"https://byteb=
