V5c"></div></figure>
<hr>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:left"><im=
g alt=3D"Image represents a visual depiction of an algorithm, likely for st=
ring manipulation.  The top section shows an input string 'a a c a b b a' p=
